  "scope": "Unchanged RequestManager, RequestModule, RequestType, TradeModule, TradeContainer (with TradeListener), TradeCloseEvent, TradeInterfacePlugin, RunScript.processInput, InputType, Globals, IronmanManager/IronmanMode, MapDistance, Item, Definition, Container with ContainerEvent/ContainerListener/ContainerType/SortType, Component, ComponentDefinition, ComponentPlugin, CloseEvent, InterfaceType, Plugin, Initializable, the complete InterfaceManager, ClientInfo, IoBuffer and the WindowsPane, Interface, CloseInterface, InterfaceConfig, Config, RunScriptPacket, StringPacket, AccessMask and ContainerPacket writers with their contexts, on JDK 11, each case in a fresh class loader, with the pinned interface_configs.json. Original text inserted at generation time: Location.withinDistance and getDistance; PacketDispatch sendString, sendIfaceSettings, sendRunScript and sendInterfaceConfig; ContentAPI removeAttribute and both sendInputDialogue forms; Node and the ItemDefinition fields and methods Item, Container and the trade reach (isTradeable, hasAction, hasDestroyAction included); the ItemConfigParser constants; InterfaceConfigParser with a string reader. Recording adapters: Player (fields from the case, attributes and extensions as maps), PlayerDetails, the session (fixed mode, zero ISAAC), PacketDispatch.sendMessage, ContentAPI sendMessage/sendDialogue/setVarp (Config writer)/log, DialogueInterpreter, ZoneMonitor.canRequest, ItemDefinition.getExamine, InterfaceListeners, the open/close events, WeaponInterface, FriendsListInterface, spellbook 192, no familiar or autocast, GroundItemManager.create, PlayerMonitor.logTrade, AIRepository with DoublingMoney, AssistSession, GameWorld ticks/settings/Pulser and Pulse construction, and an inventory listener that records update slots and refreshes. Modelled in Support.java: the tail of processIfAction (component lookup, hidden check, getPlugin, handle), the InputPromptResponse branch around RunScript.processInput, running a submitted alert pulse body, and logout as InterfaceManager.close then closeSingleTab. Not exercised: pulse scheduling, the real InventoryListener, GameMessage bytes, examine text, AIPlayer bots, the duel arena and AssistSession content.",
